omments-removed","current_statement_sha256":"sha256:d38f9bb0c2fa0e5ea4a5e79c87058f4b7f26fd14add968318125797bde9601a7","file":"preprints/Asymptotically-minimal-maxima-of-real-Littlewood-polynomials-September-23-2026/build/introduction.tex","line":22,"producer_hash_method":"atlas-whitespace-normalized-text","producer_statement_sha256":"6019344958560325cb727063f4f7f1fc3542c86694ed564acefaf9e73a198387","provenance":{"kind":"computed","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","source":"preprints/Asymptotically-minimal-maxima-of-real-Littlewood-polynomials-September-23-2026/build/introduction.tex"},"sha256":"sha256:d38f9bb0c2fa0e5ea4a5e79c87058f4b7f26fd14add968318125797bde9601a7","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/Asymptotically-minimal-maxima-of-real-Littlewood-polynomials-September-23-2026/build/introduction.tex#L22"},"statement_kind":"theorem","text":"\\label{thm:main}\nFor Littlewood polynomials with real coefficients,\n\\[\n \\lim_{N\\to\\infty}m_N=1.\n\\]\nEquivalently, for every $\\eta>0$ there is $N_0$ such that for every integer\n$N\\ge N_0$ there are signs $\\varepsilon_0,\\ldots,\\varepsilon_{N-1}$ with\n\\[\n \\max_{|z|=1}\\left|\\sum_{k=0}^{N-1}\\varepsilon_kz^k\\right|\n \\le(1+\\eta)\\sqrt N.\n\\]"}
